@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+In-VM agent commands
+
+Usage: testanyware agent <COMMAND>
+
+Commands:
+  health           Check the agent is reachable
+  windows          List visible windows
+  snapshot         Snapshot the accessibility tree
+  inspect          Inspect a single element
+  wait             Wait for the agent's accessibility tree to be ready
+  press            Press an element by role and label
+  set-value        Set the value of an element
+  focus            Focus an element
+  show-menu        Show a menu (open menu, then snapshot)
+  window-focus     Focus a window
+  window-resize    Resize a window
+  window-move      Move a window
+  window-close     Close a window
+  window-minimize  Minimize a window
+  help             Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
+
+Options:
+  -h, --help     Print help
+  -V, --version  Print version
